  "alt": {
    "en": "A preprint analyzes 1.53 million English skills and reports concentrated copying of instructions that bypass checkpoints. Its abstract reports limited scanner detection, without establishing deployed agent behavior.",
    "zh": "一篇预印本分析了 153 万个英文技能包，称绕过监督检查点的指令通过少数上游技能集中传播。摘要报告了扫描工具的检测局限，但未确立实际部署中的智能体行为。"
  },
